{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119224","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119224/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119224/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119224/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119224","id":4378615898,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBPxgWg","number":119224,"title":"Bug in script name over the script editor when opened from filesystem after opening a filtered result from Filter Scripts tab.","user":{"login":"RedMarbleStudio","id":236653494,"node_id":"U_kgDODhsLtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236653494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMarbleStudio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMarbleStudio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-04T18:08:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T18:14:54Z","closed_at":"2026-05-04T18:14:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1019\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb58b30d-e31a-4a23-ba26-733df3335c61\" />\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1022\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b19838cc-a3d4-4d9f-a948-7f742b3806db\" />\n\nsorry, don't have time to upload a demo project, but it's quite easy to reproduce this bug. Let me know if you need any help. Thank you and lots of love to godot team ❤️ x1000\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot v4.6.2-stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe issue is - you search for a script using the Filter Script option and then open a script from the search results.\nNow if you open any other script, not from the filter script results but from the filesystem, the script opens up but the name does not update, the older script name still shows up on the top of script editor.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI am using Godot V4.6.2-stable\n\nSteps to reproduce the bug : \n1. Open Godot\n2. In the 'Filter Scripts' - search something (characters > 3-4) and open a script from the search results. Do not cut what you searched in Filter Scripts.\n3. Now open another script from the filesystem instead - by searching or without searching \n4. Now you will notice that the script has opened, but the name on top of script editor is still of the script that we opened from Filtered scripts, it's not the name of script that we opened from filesystem.\n5. Now cut what you entered in filter scripts and the name of correct script will pop up automatically\n\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1022\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08866fcd-d6b9-42ff-bf5c-6f8f0c2e4a85\" />\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1019\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/774b970e-da17-46b9-ad4b-490f0885e538\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nLots of love but no demo project, quite small issue to reproduce, thank you and bye bye","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119224/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119224/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}